                                            "The driver of a taxi."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47997a7c-f5ff-4a79-978e-570f883db51f",
                                                "sense_id": "b91e616f-a776-3aa3-96c9-42a0b906ec0a",
                                                "text": "A girl in the bakery, aged sixteen, used oaths that would have defeated a cabman."
